@@ -0,0 +1,191 @@
+---
+area: canvas
+level: 2
+last_updated: 2026-03-10
+status: draft
+---
+
+# TextV2 Object Type
+
+## Overview
+
+TextV2 is a pure text object type designed for canvas typography without speech bubble styling. Unlike the original `TextObject` (which is tightly coupled to bubble rendering with tails, strokes, and fill colors), TextV2 focuses exclusively on text content with proper visual scaling behavior during transforms.
+
+## Motivation
+
+The original `TextObject` serves as a speech bubble with bubble shapes, tails, and strokes. This creates friction for users who just want plain text:
+
+1. **No visual scaling** -- resizing a speech bubble doesn't scale the text visually; fontSize stays fixed while only the container changes
+2. **Unnecessary complexity** -- bubble properties (style, tail, stroke) clutter the UI for simple text use cases
+3. **No fontSize-scale synchronization** -- scaling the bounding box has no effect on the underlying fontSize value
+
+TextV2 solves these by providing a lightweight text object where transforms visually scale text in real-time and bake the result into fontSize on completion.
+
+## Data Model
+
+```typescript
+// components/canvas/types.ts
+export type TextV2Object = BaseObject & {
+  type: 'textV2';
+  text: string;
+  fontSize: number;
+  fontFamily: string;
+  textColor: string;
+  textAlign?: 'left' | 'center' | 'right';
+  textOrientation?: 'horizontal' | 'vertical';
+  isBold?: boolean;
+  isItalic?: boolean;
+  isUnderline?: boolean;
+  padding?: number;
+  lineHeight?: number;
+  letterSpacing?: number;
+  parentId?: string;
+};
+```
+
+### Default Values
+
+| Property            | Default        | Notes                                 |
+| ------------------- | -------------- | ------------------------------------- |
+| `fontSize`          | `24`           | In canvas units (pixels)              |
+| `fontFamily`        | `'Arial'`      | Any web-safe or loaded font           |
+| `textColor`         | `'black'`      | CSS color string                      |
+| `textAlign`         | `'left'`       | `'left'`, `'center'`, or `'right'`    |
+| `textOrientation`   | `'horizontal'` | `'horizontal'` or `'vertical'`        |
+| `padding`           | `4`            | Internal padding in canvas units      |
+| `lineHeight`        | `1.2`          | Multiplier                            |
+| `letterSpacing`     | `0`            | In canvas units                       |
+| `width`             | `200`          | Initial bounding box width            |
+| `height`            | `40`           | Initial bounding box height           |
+| `rotation`          | `0`            | Degrees                               |
+| `scaleX` / `scaleY` | `1`            | Always reset to 1 after transform end |
+
+## Component Inventory
+
+| Component                        | Path                                                  | Responsibility                                                |
+| -------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------- |
+| `TextV2Node`                     | `components/canvas/konva/text-v2-node.tsx`            | Konva rendering: Group + Rect (hit area) + Text + Transformer |
+| `FloatingTextV2Editor`           | `components/canvas/floating/FloatingTextV2Editor.tsx` | HTML textarea overlay for inline text editing                 |
+| `TextV2Info`                     | `components/canvas/object-info/text-v2-info.tsx`      | Right-side property panel for TextV2 properties               |
+| `createTextV2`                   | `utils/canvas/text-v2.ts`                             | Factory function to create new TextV2 objects                 |
+| `calculateTextV2TransformResult` | `utils/canvas/text-v2.ts`                             | Pure function: compute new fontSize/width/height from scale   |
+| `useCanvasTextV2Events`          | `hooks/use-canvas-text-v2-events.ts`                  | Drag end and transform end event handlers                     |
+
+## How It Works
+
+### Creation
+
+Users create a TextV2 object by:
+
+1. **Toolbar button** -- clicking the Text tool button in the bottom toolbar
+2. **Keyboard shortcut** -- pressing `T` (the primary text hotkey; speech bubble is `Shift+T`)
+3. **AI chat** -- Gazai-chan can create text via tool calls
+
+On creation, the system places a TextV2 object at the click position with default dimensions (200x40) and switches to the select tool. The factory function `createTextV2()` in `utils/canvas/text-v2.ts` generates the object with a UUID and default property values.
+
+### Rendering
+
+The text renders as a Konva Group with a transparent hit area, a Text node, and a Transformer (when selected). Horizontal text is top-aligned; vertical text is middle-aligned.
+
+### Transform Behavior
+
+TextV2 has two distinct transform modes depending on which anchor the user drags. All 8 anchors are enabled, with rotation support.
+
+#### Side Anchors (resize container only)
+
+Dragging a side anchor (`middle-left`, `middle-right`, `top-center`, `bottom-center`) resizes the text container without changing the font size. The text reflows to fill the new container dimensions. During the drag, the text remains visually undistorted.
+
+#### Corner Anchors (scale text proportionally)
+
+Dragging a corner anchor (`top-left`, `top-right`, `bottom-left`, `bottom-right`) scales the text uniformly -- both fontSize and container dimensions change proportionally while maintaining aspect ratio. The opposite corner stays fixed (e.g., dragging top-left anchors bottom-right). On release, the new fontSize is baked into the data model and scale resets to 1.
+
+### Inline Text Editing
+
+Double-clicking a TextV2 object enters inline editing mode. An HTML `<textarea>` overlay appears exactly over the Konva text, matching all typography styles scaled for the current zoom level. The canvas text is hidden during editing.
+
+- The editor tracks pan/zoom changes in real-time
+- `Escape` or blur exits editing mode
+- Canvas keyboard shortcuts are suppressed while typing
+
+### Property Panel
+
+The `TextV2Info` component renders in the right-side panel when a TextV2 object is selected. Available controls:
+
+| Control          | Type         | Description                                          |
+| ---------------- | ------------ | ---------------------------------------------------- |
+| Text content     | Textarea     | Multi-line text input                                |
+| Font family      | Select       | Font picker (reuses `FontSelect`)                    |
+| Font size        | Number input | 1-200 range                                          |
+| Text color       | Color picker | Color input with swatch (reuses `ColorInput`)        |
+| Text orientation | Toggle group | Horizontal / Vertical                                |
+| Text alignment   | Toggle group | Left / Center / Right (reuses `TextAlignSelect`)     |
+| Font style       | Toggle group | Bold / Italic / Underline (reuses `FontStyleSelect`) |
+| Line height      | Slider       | 0.5 - 3.0, step 0.1                                  |
+| Letter spacing   | Slider       | -5 - 20, step 0.5                                    |
+
+Note: Padding is stored in the data model but not exposed in the UI.
+
+### Integration Points
+
+| System             | File                                                   | How TextV2 integrates                               |
+| ------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------ | --------------------------------------------------- |
+| Tool state         | `store/tool-state.ts`                                  | `'textV2'` in `Tool` union type                     |
+| Selection          | `store/selection-store.ts`                             | `selectTextV2()` method                             |
+| Canvas rendering   | `components/canvas/gazai-canvas.tsx`                   | Rendering branch for standalone and in-frame TextV2 |
+| Mouse events       | `hooks/use-canvas-mouse-events.ts`                     | Creation handler on canvas click                    |
+| Canvas action      | `hooks/use-canvas-action.ts`                           | Wires drag/transform handlers                       |
+| Copy/paste         | `hooks/use-copy-paste.tsx`                             | `case 'textV2'` in selection dispatch               |
+| Rectangle select   | `hooks/use-canvas-mouse-events.ts`                     | TextV2 included in selection rect detection         |
+| Layers panel       | `components/canvas/layers-info/sortable-tree-item.tsx` | Layer display with text content label               |
+| Object icon        | `components/canvas/layers-info/object-icon.tsx`        | `Type` icon from lucide-react                       |
+| Frame child render | `components/canvas/konva/selected-node-in-panel.tsx`   | TextV2 rendering inside frames                      |
+| Frame containment  | `utils/canvas/object-transforms.ts`                    | `updateFrameContainment()` on drag end              |
+| Object limits      | `hooks/use-canvas-mouse-events.ts`                     | Counted toward canvas object limit                  |
+
+## Differences from TextObject (Speech Bubble)
+
+| Aspect             | TextObject (Speech Bubble)           | TextV2 (Pure Text)                        |
+| ------------------ | ------------------------------------ | ----------------------------------------- |
+| Bubble rendering   | Yes (rounded, cloud, thought, etc.)  | No                                        |
+| Tail               | Yes (draggable tail with controls)   | No                                        |
+| Stroke/fill        | bubbleColor, bubbleStrokeWidth/Color | No bubble properties                      |
+| Visual scaling     | No (fontSize fixed during resize)    | Yes (corner drag scales text)             |
+| fontSize sync      | No                                   | Yes (baked on transform end)              |
+| Side anchor resize | Resizes bubble + text together       | Resizes container only, text unchanged    |
+| Corner anchor      | Uniform resize of bubble             | Uniform text scaling with fontSize update |
+| Inline editing     | No (edit in side panel only)         | Yes (double-click to edit on canvas)      |
+| Toolbar hotkey     | `Shift+T`                            | `T`                                       |
+| Vertical alignment | Middle (always)                      | Top (horizontal) / Middle (vertical)      |
+
+## Test Coverage
+
+| Test File                                        | Type | Coverage Area                               |
+| ------------------------------------------------ | ---- | ------------------------------------------- |
+| `tests/unit/canvas/text-v2.test.ts`              | Unit | Factory, type guards, transform calculation |
+| `tests/e2e/canvas/canvas-object-text-v2.spec.ts` | E2E  | Creation, editing, resize, copy/paste, undo |
+
+### Unit Tests
+
+- `createTextV2()` returns correct defaults and unique IDs
+- `createTextV2()` respects custom values
+- `isTextV2Object()` type guard correctness
+- `isTransformable()` includes TextV2
+- `calculateTextV2TransformResult()` scales fontSize and dimensions correctly
+- Minimum fontSize of 1 is enforced
+
+### E2E Tests
+
+- Create TextV2 from toolbar click
+- Create TextV2 via `T` hotkey
+- Edit text content via property panel
+- Change fontSize via property panel
+- Delete TextV2
+- Copy/paste TextV2
+- Undo/redo TextV2 operations
+
